(6866920, 1033695, 11769, '<td valign="top">Wow, a great shot. I am slipping and gave this a 9. Was headed for a 10 but forgot to comment on this challenge. <br/> <br/>My comment was going to go something like this. I found myself looking at my little buddy in his cage. Gets all the food and medical care he would want. Nice temps in the house. Then I glanced out the window and the birds out there were playing, fighting, cavorting around like crazy. The thrill of freedoms unknown, around every corner is a danger but when I look at my caged friend I feel sad. My bird likes to watch TV.</td>', 'Wow, a great shot. I am slipping and gave this a 9. Was headed for a 10 but forgot to comment on this challenge.  My comment was going to go something like this. I found myself looking at my little buddy in his cage. Gets all the food and medical care he would want. Nice temps in the house. Then I glanced out the window and the birds out there were playing, fighting, cavorting around like crazy. The thrill of freedoms unknown, around every corner is a danger but when I look at my caged friend I feel sad. My bird likes to watch TV.', '2012-09-21 01:26:32.000000', NULL, 0),
